            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- When an app sends a notification identical to an earlier one, such as a second “Verify your email”, Karui for Mac no longer treats the new one as already read. Reading it on the Mac now clears the alert on your iPhone, and the link opens the new email.
